    {
      "id": "V-mn7ZrJDRixKoTGVpeHB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1822.3522110733538,
      "y": 19401.16441545898,
      "width": 1141.139892578125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 232337536,
      "version": 1065,
      "versionNonce": 617307510,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789357412072,
      "created": 1789178816130,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.接收请求\n2.对接收到的数据（接口数据模型：schemas中定义的模型【BaseModel】）做转换（业务要使用的数据模型【领域数据模型】）\n3. 调用业务逻辑处理层（领域数据模型）返回领域数据模型\n4. 将领域数据模型转成接口数据模型",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.接收请求\n2.对接收到的数据（接口数据模型：schemas中定义的模型【BaseModel】）做转换（业务要使用的数据模型【领域数据模型】）\n3. 调用业务逻辑处理层（领域数据模型）返回领域数据模型\n4. 将领域数据模型转成接口数据模型",
