      "seed": 2065409920,
      "version": 1861,
      "versionNonce": 1647015670,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789357412072,
      "created": 1789179374665,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.拥有数据库的连接（同步连接、异步连接）\n2.执行SQL语句（根据业务逻辑获取怎样数据）\n3. 写操作commit()、读操作不需要",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.拥有数据库的连接（同步连接、异步连接）\n2.执行SQL语句（根据业务逻辑获取怎样数据）\n3. 写操作commit()、读操作不需要",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ebONrpeBPlVf6RhGqS_dO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2057.440040135988,
      "y": 19883.18968422349,
      "width": 615.679931640625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1436536960,
      "version": 590,
      "versionNonce": 1101273962,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789357412072,
      "created": 1789179416221,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "典型的IO/网络操作能用异步的就不要用同步。\nIO:对数据库读写操作：async  def  read():   async def write():\n网络：从网络获取数据或者发送数据： 对大语言模型调用：ainvoke()",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "典型的IO/网络操作能用异步的就不要用同步。\nIO:对数据库读写操作：async  def  read():   async def write():\n网络：从网络获取数据或者发送数据： 对大语言模型调用：ainvoke()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
