      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "state定义：\nclass   InsightState(TypeDict):\n\n    topic_key:str\n    retrieved_records: list[RetrievedEvidence]\n    records_by_id: dict[str,RetrievedEvidence]\n    relevance_scores:dict[str,float]\n    record_ids_by_section:dict[str,list[str]] \n     section_evidence_records:list[list[RetrievedEvidence]]（摘要生成节\n点，直接获取的）\n",
      "fontSize": 43.42499999999999,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "state定义：\nclass   InsightState(TypeDict):\n\n    topic_key:str\n    retrieved_records: list[RetrievedEvidence]\n    records_by_id: dict[str,RetrievedEvidence]\n    relevance_scores:dict[str,float]\n    record_ids_by_section:dict[str,list[str]] \n     section_evidence_records:list[list[RetrievedEvidence]]（摘要生成节点，直接获取的）\n",
